post_install() {
  cat <<'EOF'
Optional extensions from OpenSec, which this package does not install:

  pi-bolt install npm:opensec-pi-subagents   # specialized agents in separate sessions
  pi-bolt install npm:opensec-pi-todo        # todo list shown above the editor
  pi-bolt install npm:opensec-pi-fff         # fast file and content search

Upgrade this copy with pacman. `pi-bolt update` replaces the executable next to
itself, and this one lives in pacman-owned /usr/lib/pi-bolt.

CPUs with AVX2 (Intel Haswell, AMD Zen and later) can use the faster build from
pi-bolt-avx2-bin instead.
EOF
}
